On 7 May 2010 20:23, Luke Bergen <lukeabergen@gmail.com> wrote:

> hmm, I've often wondered about that.  What exactly is the difference
> between {cikygau} and {cikyri'a}?


For example:

 mi cikygau do fi'o cikri'a lo junla
 I do your being woken up by a clock.

{mi} prepares the clock so that it wakes {do} up, hence the agent of {do}'s
waking up.

